{"title":"2025 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\">Problem 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the average value of the function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/2/a82b7a351817b556e604fadd1cff79dc5fc86c9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = \\dfrac{1}{1+x^{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"115\" height=\"40\" /> on the interval <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/f/39f506ebeeeb72f62147990614a67f4e30b7c751.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[-1,1]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"48\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/0/18085791d45d9f79a93a60fb9386951e78fa4968.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\dfrac{\\pi}{3}  \\quad \t\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\dfrac{\\pi}{4}  \\quad \t\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\dfrac{\\pi}{6}  \\quad \t\\textbf{(D)}\\ 0  \\quad \t\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\dfrac{\\pi}{2}  \\quad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"325\" height=\"34\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The average value of a function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/9/659a6a2610357101d77dbae8eb9bf0b3100c08fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/2/da2e551d2ca2155b8d8f4935d2e9757722c9bab6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[a, b]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/2/f62c5c415c16e62c929447a3fbafa5daf914689f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{b - a} \\times \\int_{a}^{b} g(x) \\,dx$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"152\" height=\"46\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/8/18850c5a6f67139956c8c1e35094c0a864ecb8ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b &gt; a$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"13\" />. This means that the average value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/b/82b34f51b53139bc9c544de361cd0ef746f87e7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{1 - (-1)} \\times \\int_{-1}^{1} f(x) \\, dx = \\frac{1}{2} \\times \\int_{-1}^{1} \\frac{1}{1 + x^{2}} \\, dx$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"352\" height=\"47\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/f/a1f1a40af9aaff68157252a9252c94a9cedcb0d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{1}{2} \\times [\\tan^{-1}{x}]_{-1}^{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"142\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/2/bd2de48028a8401d578aaf722eb7e995361b732d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{1}{2}(\\tan^{-1}{1} - \\tan^{-1}{-1})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"197\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/0/8203632e3dca6fc5b81245b59375ea32fbf30705.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{1}{2} \\times 2 \\times \\tan^{-1}{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"144\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/5/d45df6b4fba8386b9fa3774713b4b20220deeb6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\tan^{-1}{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"77\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/b/bab58c930028e4d757e9b6aff57a117f4853a1d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } \\dfrac{\\pi}{4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"82\" height=\"46\" /> \n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Calculus Contest\">2025 TMTA Calculus</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Prob